Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Seems like ProductLog is a monotonic function (at least for +ve values I \
think, but double check). Hence, false alarm increases with food reward. Need \
to be careful and find under what conditions this solution holds. Remember \
case (b) in notes should satisfy etc etc.\
\>", "Subsubsection",
